docs {
  WARNING: this wipes and replaces the entire medicines table with the
  items given here. "today" is optional — if set, the dashboard/grouping
  uses it instead of the real date (useful for replaying the judges'
  test cases from agents/P02_pharmacy_expiry_public.json). Omit "today"
  to go back to using the real date.
}
